# Save the Children (battlefield.save_the_children): a helper who won earlier and has not reported yet. Two level 75
# Warriors of San d'Oria by Hut_Door, both with 1-3 current: main at Status 2 (the registrant), bob at Status 4 (GMs:
# bob won and opened the hut, and has not seen Endracion). main leads bob. main's menu, area 1: registered, bob
# registered with it (the clearance copied); main enters. bob, holding the clearance: onEntryTrigger's entered-party
# arm: BattlefieldMission:checkRequirements as no registrant: not completed, but current with Status 4 >= 2 (the
# `status >= required` disjunct; Status 4 fails the registrant's `status == required`): the menu (enterExisting 1);
# updated: entered. checkSkipCutscene runs its status arm (current, Status 4 > skipMissionStatus 2: true), but
# updateEvent keeps only number params, so the boolean never reaches the 0x05C: bob's update reads as main's
# ([2,0,0,600]). The three Fodderchiefs killed: won; BattlefieldMission:onBattlefieldWin for each: both current, so
# both get battlefieldWin 32; 32001's canSkipCS: main 0 (Status 2 is not above 2), bob 1 (Status 4 > 2: the status
# arm, bob has not completed 1-3). main's finish: 1-3's handler (section 2: the key, the title, Status 3). bob's
# finish: no title, no XP; 1-3's 32001 handler is in section 2 (current, Status below 3), which fails at Status 4:
# nothing, the key not given again and Status 4 kept. No timing or RNG dependency.
lists GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrigger GhelsbaOutpost/onEventUpdate/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
bob: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
bob: mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
bob: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
login
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
bob: login
bob: missionstatus Sandoria 4           # a GM: won, the hut opened, not reported
invite bob
bob: accept
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # registered in area 1; bob registered with it
finish                                  # main entered
bob: trigger Hut_Door                   # bob's clearance: current, Status 4 >= 2: the menu (enterExisting)
bob: update 32000 option=1              # entered: Status 4 > 2: skippable
bob: finish
tick 2000                               # the Fodderchiefs spawn
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+1
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+2               # won: 32001 to main (canSkipCS 0) and bob (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                  # 1-3: the key, the title, Status 3
bob: finish                             # bob: Status 4: no 1-3 section: nothing
